{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-narrative-ledger#card-zh","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-narrative-ledger","commit":"ba7c3189fe266319570e1616e8941604162259f2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Narrative Ledger 为 DSH 提供叙事状态核验工具。它注册 inspect、verify、query 三个工具，可检查故事实体与谓词、验证事件顺序和事实断言/撤销、发现单值冲突，并按序号投影有效事实及角色知识。核验可比较 canon 来源哈希并将内容寻址报告写入指定目录。适合长篇小说、互动叙事和游戏剧情的连续性维护；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:27-35","lib/narrative-ledger.mjs:205-220"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-narrative-ledger#card-en","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-narrative-ledger","commit":"ba7c3189fe266319570e1616e8941604162259f2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Narrative Ledger provides inspect, verify, and query tools for story continuity. It checks event order, facts, contradictions, canon hashes, and character knowledge. Verification writes a hashed report. It suits fiction and game projects without API keys or external services.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:27-35","lib/narrative-ledger.mjs:205-220"]}
