{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-narrative-ledger#feature-1","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-narrative-ledger","commit":"ba7c3189fe266319570e1616e8941604162259f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Narrative Ledger 的功能「检查叙事事件」：验证事实断言、撤销与场景事件的顺序和剧情时间。调用 DSH verify 或 CLI verify，输入 manifest 和事件文件，查看验证状态及发现项。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:30","lib/narrative-ledger.mjs:127-175"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-narrative-ledger#feature-2","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-narrative-ledger","commit":"ba7c3189fe266319570e1616e8941604162259f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Narrative Ledger 的功能「追踪角色知识」：依据角色见证断言或参与传递有效事实的场景，计算角色在故事中的已知事实。调用 query 并指定 throughSeq，返回该时点的事实 ID 和知识 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/narrative-ledger.mjs:143-175","index.js:31"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-narrative-ledger#feature-3","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-narrative-ledger","commit":"ba7c3189fe266319570e1616e8941604162259f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Narrative Ledger 的功能「核对 canon 来源」：读取 manifest 声明的来源文件并比较 SHA-256，标记当前、陈旧或缺失来源。通过 inspect 查看预期哈希，或通过 verify 生成核验结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/narrative-ledger.mjs:178-188","lib/narrative-ledger.mjs:205-220"]}
{"unit_id":"dongsheng123132__dsh-narrative-ledger#feature-4","repo":"dongsheng123132/dsh-narrative-ledger","commit":"ba7c3189fe266319570e1616e8941604162259f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Narrative Ledger 的功能「发布核验报告」：将核验结果规范化为 JSON，以内容哈希命名写入显式 artifactDir，并回读确认文件内容。该功能由 verify 操作触发，输出报告路径、哈希和字节数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/narrative-ledger.mjs:193-203","lib/narrative-ledger.mjs:216-220"]}
